        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 7131-630, Stainless Steel 4 x 16 Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 4\" x 16\" commercial door pull plate with 8-3/8\" pull handle. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made in the USA from .050\" thick solid stainless steel. Brushed stainless steel finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-7131-630_size.gif?v=1704354567\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 7131-630 Pull Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-pull-plate-polished-brass-or-oil-rubbed-bronze-don-jo-7131-xxx\"><b>Polished Brass 4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-pull-plate-polished-brass-or-oil-rubbed-bronze-don-jo-7131-xxx\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze 4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/economy-priced-aluminum-4-x-16-pull-plates-don-jo-7131-628\"><b>Brushed Aluminum 4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 7131-630 Commercial Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7131-630.pdf?v=1704262267\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 7131-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> Get a matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-4-x-16-push-plate-don-jo-71-ss\"><b>4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>",
